include CHANGELOG.md CITATION.cff CONTRIBUTING.md DISCLAIMER.md LICENSE NOTICE README.md SECURITY.md THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
recursive-include docs *.md
recursive-include examples *.py *.md
